ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nJack, Nina, and Li Ming form a small team and are preparing for this semester's subject research project. One day, Jack sees Nina and Li Ming in a meeting. Jack does not go to disturb them, he just quietly observes at the door. Nina keeps waving to Li Ming to look at a document, but Li Ming focuses more on his own work. Jack notices that the atmosphere is a bit off. He is a bit worried.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Jack prepare to do?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Takes the initiative to find other colleagues, chats to distract his attention.\nB. Quietly waits, communicates with them after the meeting ends.\nC. Decides to join the meeting himself, to understand the ongoing discussion and ease the atmosphere.\nD. Interrupts Nina and Li Ming's meeting, stops their collaboration.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006626861043323,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e05ad6006945d27fb9c7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367578579,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"430c158a9b1241df976e5e713f7eafc0"}